    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elementum</strong> is a <strong>spell-crafting</strong> roguelike with <strong>bullet hell</strong> elements. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defeat all encounters in a room and choose your reward!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2724830/extras/5def35668aa8e818cb02b47781ea3273.poster.avif?t=1753726221\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2724830/extras/5def35668aa8e818cb02b47781ea3273.webm?t=1753726221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2724830/extras/5def35668aa8e818cb02b47781ea3273.mp4?t=1753726221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect spells, amulets and scrolls to build your own loadout!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2724830/extras/fe658cecac7bd3b8e44d61c3be9baa2d.poster.avif?t=1753726221\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2724830/extras/fe658cecac7bd3b8e44d61c3be9baa2d.webm?t=1753726221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2724830/extras/fe658cecac7bd3b8e44d61c3be9baa2d.mp4?t=1753726221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enhance your spells with unique upgrades to further customize your build!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2724830/extras/a747b80b7cabb344c908f094357c5f27.poster.avif?t=1753726221\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2724830/extras/a747b80b7cabb344c908f094357c5f27.webm?t=1753726221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2724830/extras/a747b80b7cabb344c908f094357c5f27.mp4?t=1753726221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock and play 4 different character classes, each with their own unique set of abilities!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2724830/extras/c3b5f33661d0da859c9e161a9a3a19c4.poster.avif?t=1753726221\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2724830/extras/c3b5f33661d0da859c9e161a9a3a19c4.webm?t=1753726221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2724830/extras/c3b5f33661d0da859c9e161a9a3a19c4.mp4?t=1753726221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fast-paced spell-casting combat!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Discover over 30 different spells and amulets that will help you create powerful synergies!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Randomized encounters and rewards ensure that every run is different from the others!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Craft your own spells by collecting and equipping various upgrades that will further define your build!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 4 playable classes, each with the powers of a different element!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elementum</strong> is a <strong>spell-crafting</strong> roguelike with <strong>bullet hell</strong> elements. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defeat all encounters in a room and choose your reward!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2724830/extras/5def35668aa8e818cb02b47781ea3273.poster.avif?t=1753726221\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2724830/extras/5def35668aa8e818cb02b47781ea3273.webm?t=1753726221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2724830/extras/5def35668aa8e818cb02b47781ea3273.mp4?t=1753726221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect spells, amulets and scrolls to build your own loadout!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2724830/extras/fe658cecac7bd3b8e44d61c3be9baa2d.poster.avif?t=1753726221\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2724830/extras/fe658cecac7bd3b8e44d61c3be9baa2d.webm?t=1753726221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2724830/extras/fe658cecac7bd3b8e44d61c3be9baa2d.mp4?t=1753726221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enhance your spells with unique upgrades to further customize your build!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2724830/extras/a747b80b7cabb344c908f094357c5f27.poster.avif?t=1753726221\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2724830/extras/a747b80b7cabb344c908f094357c5f27.webm?t=1753726221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2724830/extras/a747b80b7cabb344c908f094357c5f27.mp4?t=1753726221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock and play 4 different character classes, each with their own unique set of abilities!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2724830/extras/c3b5f33661d0da859c9e161a9a3a19c4.poster.avif?t=1753726221\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2724830/extras/c3b5f33661d0da859c9e161a9a3a19c4.webm?t=1753726221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2724830/extras/c3b5f33661d0da859c9e161a9a3a19c4.mp4?t=1753726221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fast-paced spell-casting combat!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Discover over 30 different spells and amulets that will help you create powerful synergies!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Randomized encounters and rewards ensure that every run is different from the others!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Craft your own spells by collecting and equipping various upgrades that will further define your build!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 4 playable classes, each with the powers of a different element!</p></li></ul>",
